{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d81a2949f91c330c4c41322b17c0998d78b03c3b4d74b43519c74911eb5cdf92", "ja": "お疲れ様、星梨花。\nあれ？　随分おめかししてるんだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，星梨花。\n咦？今天打扮得特别漂亮啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "bd2e951dfd7c6611bc554476b778354f3768000f8c2b968d75163d1ed65d1aff", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　今日は時間が\nたくさんあったので、オシャレして来ちゃいました♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！今天因为时间\n很充裕，所以我就精心打扮了一番过来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "405ad26ca34cb9bd1ce3b19cb3829bcfc2bbb579992e944a12555d5a40578341", "ja": "わたしのお気に入りの服なんです。小物も一緒に\n合わせてみたんですけど……どうですか？", "zh": "这是我最喜欢的衣服。我还搭配了相称的小饰品……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a5e68a4fcbc48bda6ff9229011040603ee63368ade2ef72aaae070e0f29ddaef", "ja": "よく似合ってるよ。\n上品な雰囲気が、星梨花にピッタリだ！", "zh": "非常合身。\n这种优雅的气质，和星梨花特别相配！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "57726ab3158379dbf4ea383e332adce17a49bfb7591a21d039a4b95276d649b4", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます。\nジュニオールも、この服がお気に入りなんですよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢您。\n朱尼奥尔也很喜欢这件衣服呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1005_p", "source_sha256": "93fa3aebeea86f2140b3f13f2417e8312efe6f84adf352ba2b6a477e34f82113", "ja": "ジュニオールが？", "zh": "是ジュ尼奥尔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "e989969f50a1c2263082c8cbb347bc1df9ad0feb036dd824d0a522be4dad98b2", "ja": "はい！　お散歩の時に着ていくと、\nすっごく喜んでくれるんです。", "zh": "是的！散步时穿着这个一起去，他会特别开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c17fb8e13507ea1e245869ad437b4846940a3880535c00be8032e43a0db219bb", "ja": "へえ、服の好みがわかるとは……。\nジュニオールは賢いんだな！", "zh": "哦，居然能看出对衣服的喜好……朱尼奥尔真聪明啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "2ef298231159579f096d30153f7f073ce3a26e6853a6b271fe1ba13a6a61e969", "ja": "はい。……でも、言われてみれば不思議ですね。\nいつもはわたしの服を気にしたりしないんですけど。", "zh": "是的……不过，仔细想想还真是不可思议呢。\n平时它也不会在意我的衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "3a6c580fc39f1749ede3015c39eea2f949a3ed1f168088bf4897030f486f26d8", "ja": "この服の時だけ、たしかにご機嫌なんですよね。\nうーん、どうしてなんでしょう……？", "zh": "只有穿这件衣服的时候，它确实会特别开心呢。\n嗯——这是为什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1010_p", "source_sha256": "843c902d6b1ec146bf5caf26578188a02ca183283d41d273270eedbe825f63be", "ja": "その服の時だけ、なのか？　……もしかしたら、\n服装に反応しているわけじゃないのかもな。", "zh": "难道只有穿那件衣服的时候才会这样吗？……说不定，并不是服装引起的反应。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "ff144ed2a8c2fc7c65900751e9743223d82a94a28e11f86426b057a6a6c462e9", "ja": "……どういうことですか、\n{$P$}さん？", "zh": "……这是什么意思呢，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1012_p", "source_sha256": "70533f19536d31b381317089104934b74ac6b13164d934803fa53a69a68ff65b", "ja": "例えばだけど、お気に入りの服を\n着て嬉しそうな星梨花に……とか？", "zh": "比如说，给穿着最喜欢的衣服、看起来很开心的星梨花……之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "7e17fb551ae076823fd8e1bf97a96a291ada1b3e18b4f85af7f28c636aa4b4d9", "ja": "あっ！　わたしがうれしそうだから、\nジュニオールも一緒にうれしくなっちゃうんですね！", "zh": "啊！因为我看起来很开心，所以朱尼奥尔也跟着开心起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a65b3bd0c3c6e633d30801561ad22905a0ac3cf859da9b9ad17a5b25e1d91ef1", "ja": "まあ、例えばの話だけどな……。\nでもジュニオールの気持ちは、少しわかる気がするよ。", "zh": "哎，我也只是打个比方啦……\n不过我感觉，自己也能稍微理解小罗的心情呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "affac38c05da8123262225001ce3b90f156a3028f39b5b04697f61819675cf83", "ja": "え？　……{$P$}さんも\nわたしを見て、うれしくなっちゃうってことですか？", "zh": "咦？……也就是说，看到我，{$P$}先生也会变得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c61f7a40ddaa592aa55e7d295c65dfc994e6ba2de8865986ed23924ce19b0f6e", "ja": "うん。星梨花の嬉しそうな顔をみてると、\n温かい気持ちになるよ。", "zh": "嗯。只要看到星梨花开心的表情，\n心里就会觉得很温暖呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "3d3750d270e6e3b3d304062c609be1f099f6cf50a97d872a9c35331e9e3c35c1", "ja": "そうだったんですね！　わたし、浮かれちゃってたし、\n子供っぽいかなって思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊！我还以为自己太兴奋了，会不会显得有点孩子气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2f773bb8fd243fbc08203f6bcad11595f7a7c9d33a1e92a1d828ded8b392ce75", "ja": "ははっ、そんなことないよ。それに大人だって同じだ。\n気に入った服を着たらワクワクするしな。", "zh": "哈哈，没那回事。而且大人也一样。穿上喜欢的衣服，也会感到兴奋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "b11ae5947408a29fb9fd628c007de93cbb3fb706dc5432057df7f8b0bffaedd9", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？　じゃあもしかして、\n{$P$}さんも……？", "zh": "咦，真的吗？那难道，{$P$}先生也……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_022ser0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_022ser0454_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "7ca252deeef283b0213633c3a2c881a1a2ecd18164f94830de30de8efc09f85f", "ja": "お気に入りの服で、うれしそうにしてる\n{$P$}さん……ふふっ。", "zh": "穿着最喜欢的衣服，看起来很开心的\n{$P$}先生……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
